    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i appreciate the sentiment, i really do. but it's hard to believe people care when you're miles from the nearest neighbor and the only thing you hear for days is the wind. it feels less like 'loneliness' and more like just... being unnecessary. like the earth would just keep spinning exactly the same way without me in it at all.",
